{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F5J1ooXCUF1794828077.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共總書記習近平在廣東中山考察。</p><p></p><p>中央電視台新聞聯播，播出習近平今日到訪深中通道西人工島，了解通道建設運營情況，指出要建設粵港澳大灣區，首先要推進交通一體化，要讓深中通道更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1900.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264JR0ZRB3XK1794828149.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>習近平又到訪翠亨新區的灣區未來科技城，強調建設粵港澳大灣區是中共中央作出的重大戰略部署，希望中山抓住機遇，推動高質量發展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1900_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OU3vGxQKiO1794828180.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:38:18.274717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T22:58:08.536352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:31:11.965410+00:00","content_hash":"5bda0f27daae1b17689c81d05b81624859bd429c2e770d06183e7fed0a88320a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}